task.description:
Fix the integration test infrastructure so that `zig build test-integration` exits 0 when `BPM_TEST_DB_URL` is not set.

### Root cause

`tests/integration/helpers.zig` returns `error.MissingTestDbUrl` when `BPM_TEST_DB_URL` is not set. Zig's test runner treats any non-`SkipZigTest` error as a test failure (exit code 1). The correct behaviour is to return `error.SkipZigTest` so the runner records the test as skipped and exits 0.

`tests/integration/test_snapshot_integration.zig` has a duplicate local `testDbUrl()` function that also returns `error.MissingTestDbUrl`.

### Fix

**File 1: `tests/integration/helpers.zig`**

In `TestHarness.init()`, change:
```zig
error.EnvironmentVariableMissing => {
    std.debug.print("BPM_TEST_DB_URL is not set\n", .{});
    return error.MissingTestDbUrl;
},
```
To:
```zig
error.EnvironmentVariableMissing => {
    std.debug.print("BPM_TEST_DB_URL is not set — skipping integration test\n", .{});
    return error.SkipZigTest;
},
```

**File 2: `tests/integration/test_snapshot_integration.zig`**

In the local `testDbUrl()` helper, change:
```zig
error.EnvironmentVariableMissing => {
    std.debug.print("BPM_TEST_DB_URL is not set\n", .{});
    return error.MissingTestDbUrl;
},
```
To:
```zig
error.EnvironmentVariableMissing => {
    std.debug.print("BPM_TEST_DB_URL is not set — skipping integration test\n", .{});
    return error.SkipZigTest;
},
```

Also check all other integration test files that have their own local `testDbUrl()` copy (e.g. `definition_test.zig`, `pd03_version_test.zig`, `pd05_node_types_test.zig`, `event_store_integration_test.zig`, `db_integration_test.zig`) and apply the same fix to each one that uses `return error.MissingTestDbUrl`.

### Validation

```bash
zig build test-integration
```
Must exit 0. All integration tests should be SKIPPED (not FAILED) when `BPM_TEST_DB_URL` is not set.

```bash
zig build test
```
Must also exit 0 — no regressions.
